sequenceDiagram
  participant M as market data
  participant S as scanner/z-composite
  participant J as envelope journal
  participant G as nightly grader
  participant P as dashboard panel
  M->>S: trades/klines/ticker (per tick)
  S->>J: intel.signal (suspect list) + alerts
  G->>J: replay windows [onset-60m, onset+h]
  G->>G: labels, thresholds, latency, hit-rates
  G->>P: precision@budget, top-5@20s, latency histogram
  Note over G,P: achieved numbers beside published baselines
